      "name": "dsh-skill-project-docs",
      "title": {
        "en": "Software project documents",
        "zh": "软件研发项目管理过程文档"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Generate, rebuild and fill gaps in the 18 software R&D project-management documents (DOCX): confirm the document list and working mode first, then rebuild non-conforming documents from extracted facts and identify missing documents per project phase. One typography spec covers cover page, revision history, table of contents, numbered headings, tables and figures; template mode adds italic fill-in guidance and examples; every revision produces a new versioned file with a formal revision record.",
        "zh": "生成、重构与补齐软件研发全流程 18 类项目管理过程文档（DOCX）：先交互确认文档清单与工作模式，再从旧文档抽取事实重建规范文档、按阶段识别并补齐缺失文档。统一排版含封面、修订记录、目录、自动编号标题与图表；模板模式附斜体填写说明与示例；每次修订产出新版本文件并维护正式修订记录。"
      },
